PROCEEDING IN ABEYANCE 

Pursuant to the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission’s (the “Commission”) Notice 
Establishing Answer Period, the New England States Committee on Electricity (“NESCOE”)1 
hereby submits this answer in response to the Joint Motion of ISO New England, Inc. (“ISO-
NE”) and the Participating Transmission Owners Administrative Committee (“PTOAC”) on 
Behalf of the Participating Transmission Owners to Hold Proceeding in Abeyance (the “Joint 

1  On June 23, 2026, NESCOE filed a doc-less motion to intervene in this proceeding.  
NESCOE is the Regional State Committee for New England, representing the collective 
positions of the six New England states in regional electricity matters.
